{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 660,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc17a3b8b325373bf53cb9e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然会紧张，不过为了能绽放出茂盛的花朵，\\n我会尽全力加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a8b7e414583b408e5014238f49e631c8a543c0ce4947d25a5cfccee0f640bc0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:492464443f42bdc78327d5de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欸嘿嘿，很棒吧♪\\n是米米拼命帮我作的喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "216bec1f82e3bbf74ca6b18dc321f99cc16424f72188fdefa0c439950b361537",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "306"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be860d4b97870a13519fea98",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要吃胡萝卜就会变得很有活力喔！\\n啊，不过圣王有说过不能吃太多！",
      "source_fingerprint": "650dabc5c6c955b23af73fdbf29a3623401f5f3492f38456ab8f1b1b263daf65",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:403cf9a7cf3d09880f851919",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的吗！？那我在决赛时\\n也会努力把勇气带给大家喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b320ee89a364169de57416d37348f9e4f2f98854723f7bd1d2140439b707b60",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "308"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f50864f98aad8d60a37042e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家好──！开朗又有礼貌地打招呼\\n才能养成健全的精神！大家跟我一起来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6f42c2810d15129951d9030083cb88f7512776316d3c922b5fbea6a0905c933",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "309"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b4fc2559de79cd1b4d99b40",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……那只是别人擅自准备的，\\n跟竞赛的胜败无关。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a68f5a7c704cff0e7399900e2b534244505aba65ed5fbc301509b4c74ff33ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1be4d02bf77afae2770d8ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是吃我妈妈煮的料理的时候吧！\\n爸爸的料理很热血，妈妈的料理则很疗癒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a401be7e5e475344b3932b33de9bce8c0a73b130f7b197dc07524a4e2cf89d55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "310"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f46261e3a43e12e432e311d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会修剪趾甲跟去瀑布修行！！把身心\\n都调整到最佳状态，然后下次也要赢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2b0c006e7f1e1697afdd89f7b9f49ef2d7e937fd63c204090cc5cf09a16f9c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82fe493a7b966707c21e0b13",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "小魚でカルシウムチャージ！\\nコツコツ続ければ、いつか身長だって……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e272aa30caa948e2b24397e0747025a88edf4582287e715dbb9e207e8b777b97",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "312"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eef4d4cc9b65602c34d797f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "へへへ、みんなのリクエストに応えたんだ。\\nオリジナルの決めポーズで、応援に感謝を！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce15c0c4a7b864e8c668eb474a017516b9bb605632b6636f3125b886a09d146",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "313"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:371bfb174e5741ea9939794b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "もちろん、キャロットマンソーセージだっ！\\nシールがついてくるし、栄養も豊富だぞー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be5f43cbca69acb667ea8be848139bf13608d3eeb9d697dd41974765d719bf04",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "314"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6f3cf83de32f6864b51e3f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "美丽训练员的建言☆\\n用我们一起思考的作战下去跑的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b13d4c1a3a00491e6ad939b9061e4d4db2c8233897458914f6d7085bf4914c5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "315"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bd971b6e25f5ce45e70d9b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢！这是美丽的宝物喔☆\\n决赛我也会跑出让大家看见它的好表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8790084378f935497678ad8bc4a81579388da5016235bf2ce3a781422fe37f13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "316"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd98efa7f992f89607c6a1c8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每个人的美丽各有特色☆\\n好好珍惜你感受到的那份只属于你的美丽哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89fa9b41af10baefe947e47f74fefd8efb630f6d2ac41710625739c5920e9b0c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "317"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:048f6b6d70a953f02ffb3e3c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那就来施展一个咒语！用筷子吃下跟自己年纪\\n一样多的芝麻就能获得吉兆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bbcc8e6fe8e3e21945d31fce066604509ed472f584b3d39e9bd3054b3a91eae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "318"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c77c81569b04934f2b1a18e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊！我们走上石阶向天祈求，下来之后\\n又再走上去……就这样一起提升了运势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ba151b73fe91269a33bf54a1c9d00972c17f85de69f956e8fe642dd19e43c19",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "319"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65201c58a201584566afbc52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会抛下所有人并获胜。\\n就这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c3d09f30a7527d7a8d2cae4f2edd98bbc23091929b6f69b47cda95f9f591709",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:483d8fcc00d9ab8340a0e36b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大、大、福、福、超大福！\\n谁都挡不住比双黄蛋还要幸运的我喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5694ad76e739a5b9ad20c9183488da69cff3972ab43d09e4fd343fe3636a1f15",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "320"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0847575f2551c5d3bbef289",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想是我的父母吧！\\n毕竟他们今天还不断在观众席向我挥手呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a4ac5b951ae8708176fef2d3037bdaee0870d4f34143142f62156b431531306",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:033f15f73bba1dccf7f9ea82",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯……应该没有耶。\\n光是能跑步就让我十分满足了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1813bd522a69cd222826d8134977c83fcb1dad7ce35508a9197baa9846c76cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "322"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19ad48c3a092281b7da6ecff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "散步吧。比赛的余热还残留在体内，\\n吹吹风很舒服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f2c82d8c5592ef8064277b1c1a82f69725bf5cf65e25bc5c5a88d355e242472",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "323"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2505e81120083197f838a4bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有、有去了神社消灾解厄……\\n但却看错地图而跑到瑜珈教室……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5649872683a19cf9e8915ee97185d5986171cec83a7f504ef3af9dfb044e3435",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "324"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5512d63d8d09267520adebb0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "觉得……咦，这、这不是在……做梦吧！？\\n啊哇、啊哇哇……我赢了……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "51a82b1366c0529f6a2f9714b831367db9164d210a230934705f448502690d35",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "325"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:514bc8a7624dc26928626b99",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请、请请、请多支持……唔呃！？\\n呜呜～～咬到舌头了～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ca9aac8d7ff0e91093a647e57c457050c56ad910b9985e83b6c36acdf411a0f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "326"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cc910fc1f6525f8da6b0367",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "老实说，的确会感到紧张……不过\\n能跟那样的对手们同台奔驰让我感到很荣幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fb04859abff7cbc8ae5ba49fc2e02cb50617345b3d62738d5010cd7aaf98354",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "327"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45776b61e6d7fc724607f9a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论是否会形成那样的情况，我都会展现出\\n自己那份「让目白家引以为荣的表现」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9844f1266ce04c2827d91302c91c738763c3fe9a0a62d64352b0b2009da91448",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "328"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71cb73f7ec2d7dfc569f048f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冷、冷静……？没、没那回事……\\n我根本就没有那么……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e8e275dc14686038fc3dabb285b91131cfeb226b80606840c863bae0e91a1b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "329"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8861423143034d87050a831e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢。不过……有一点请容我订正。\\n那就是我所背负的并非压力，而是职责。",
      "source_fingerprint": "623fc9039f99ed6457fa4ad53c956e1ba2dc383558fd453e324fe4496dd89dbd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "33"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cec58d64c0aeec7fad8dd1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呃～这个嘛，总之我会尽力……\\n那个……我会加油的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "276ba7f5b0e0374615210d2050a5df803784bbedf6309f2e77528b16d5045f49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "330"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fae640290a33898740d1ac1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要、要那样想还有点太早了不是吗～！？\\n不过也对啦，我的目标……就是那样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed54772c2933f0fa5ec4abf936b15440939217d36669359b5738fd3a5e8ae992",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7bf4adc342ba20c8b143a28",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为大家看起来都好强、好耀眼……\\n就觉得好歹也要留下一点成绩！……这样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0ce5dfbbcd7b4449b7b49699072c25f8fa3818d595f12bc91a51ab8cd169b39",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "332"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9efd07b82cbf6f0b22f2a9c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竟然想学习圣王口号，这可真是值得嘉许……\\n好吧！我就赋予你学习的权利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a57717750682733c0f2dcf56ed9998218bd548fc00f693c14996f5a0067af93",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "333"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b149677de6e1ca47aee2826a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这不是当然的吗，要跟本圣王争霸耶？\\n若不是具有相当实力的赛马娘怎么会有干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6b7235c5c4e0c4b9329b24d3054ad1aa7689e9a831e4c6922eb761bfe01840d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "334"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0254016c2649c18ff9f32cb2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就赋予大家将我在决赛时从一流晋升成超一流\\n那瞬间烙印在脑海里的权利！拭目以待吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45c0a2dfa8ba094315ffedcb1ec8b2570a039c15b17a6ecd508bc507cddfbc7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "335"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:453a9fc97de06aacb48bd74c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呜！被你这么一说，想到如此普通的我\\n要前去那样的赛场打扰……嗯、嗯──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "493c81854cfb95321e41cefb0a41a55bebc9897366627155fe3bdee613688792",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "336"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de8811d9ebc48cd356325d44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请稍等一下！……咦？你说这个？\\n这是「获胜者采访时想讲的台词」小抄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "276c4e7b20cfc84cf4d970afd6fe6503150875aabd0deae14d92f4cbdaaa3e44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "337"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e4e6a49265593829b245f45",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢、谢谢！那个那个，\\n大家～！我赢了喔～谢谢你们～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53349b249c807236a93caf8daed549488f24494da769245294c13e1a86b4e2d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "338"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9f30a7abff9b4fc723e701f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想定通りならば、次のレースでも勝利を\\n収められます……期待していただけますと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9232f645befa1102c7ddd771cd7c4c00f775bc5396ece5a404c50ccb435f85a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "339"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fef037dc912fdcdb1857132",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然，我确有此意。但我也十分乐见\\n她们怀抱为了挑战我而勇敢精进的气概。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53a3853c86c8d35bd3f9cbe8294f689b38e6f643c39156922b7dbfcc18073e83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfd4a84b848f76c433ca0980",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ええ。栄養管理もマネジメントの一環です。\\n栄養面はもちろん、食べる順序まで完璧に。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68e4d517ff474e26190da0b02842c5c958a214e67da6e2b1d71cba8c07ab0736",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "340"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d81ba90dd0a80ea7c0d314cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "勝ちます――次もその次も……。\\n私の意気込みは、永劫変わりません。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a071c1ac0d53313dd9ca3d3599d0ba7239ef2378da46fb1e425ae6b295cbdab7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e1a6f9affc6ccc58e54c47",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "KP──？那是什么……呃……\\n啊，干杯！对对对，的确该KP一下呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c74b3008ac03163dd15f17228afa6c92feacbef63efd4e2856e8ad0240d6a858",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "342"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16dc5438132a32cd501c28a1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为我随心所欲地奋力去冲刺！\\n我下次也会照这个样子拿下胜利，你看着吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7534e60ce8c63be8864fa220936f4663e2ee3cb8dcb9bf0738b4e73f2ee951e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "343"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a721dc49d9433d13b5eb03b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想跟训练员，还有朋友们……嗯，果然\\n要在这里跟大家办一场庆功宴才对吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f0dfc3296a9ea093549c1b605fa2190e83cf6f1f32a9e2af2dad7b5fc21460c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "344"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2cca6b315e6ca419f9f88cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家嗨不嗨啊──！我赢了喔，fu～！\\n下一次我也会打败对手，要记得看喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef935e2ec22d2806aed7d718ac32a608fce0ab50691156f993c8e1d9a7cd1093",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "345"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb73da06efe09e18ec1c147c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对！会传LANE说「变得很厉害了嘛」喔！\\n阿姨她每次都会立刻恭喜我说☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e8c3433b99766557841b481176dd9c4c7b3b95560178416dbdd85145ae6b53f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "346"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8692559b8ad80633a08d97e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～这我都交给阿训啦☆\\n他真～的有够神的！所以我绝对会优胜☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a32db819f7c38cc43eec6c2990fc0e8f12dbecebc54433184a3a3c7d5eddc17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "347"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e613e18082c50902118a835",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想想哦，蓝色的食物！毕竟是涡轮的颜色！\\n而且很有趣！感觉可以变得更强对吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b901766b581a87f9c63dc7ca6260ac46cc8ffacf327ed81ac538b048ed4bd14",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "348"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13123e1a04bc9cff994fe96d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个嘛～早上稻荷都会替我绑头发！\\n她还说「我把干劲也一起给绑上吧」喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6edd2f188c6b24f516c203809bab4f4335d8a33433dd7950add96d1e876b62e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "349"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:099d99324e6fbf62e93049c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要说看起来「威风凛凛」的话，那应该是指\\n为了拿下胜利而不断精进的「自信」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "903a530bab306febb430edaa494900a2952859b0600d46ffab0745031d9b271c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "35"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc01d53ef026cfd1985a37b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我收到爷爷经常给的我箭书！\\n上头写着「了不起，涡轮」！耶嘿嘿～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04d6a24e0a83d48a94e547d546ed980155850af28d29c77420fe310aa80af182",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "350"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d98357eeb126fd263de77d77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我感到彼此的斗志互相碰撞，并闪耀光芒……\\n希望还能再同台较劲呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8822c7898ab01917ef3bf9025fc31bbf7d53fcda897816bd0a1b60972909449a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82548af81a7febc68cf7735a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，我是面对被认为越「艰难」的对决时，\\n就不禁会越加感到兴奋的个性……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c9b646812aef84115a2ad9e168ca2e88899e5d6211e43699c37b1c2291168be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "352"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:799e5804884919c303546b30",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "既然被那样子看待的话，我就更应该\\n成为大家所期待的「光芒」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb2b91911c67d4d9a19d2893d1d055360d466e6c0b8db14b1e1cac7696662e61",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "353"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c17531e29825f4c63c9f3506",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对，我很高兴！大概是因为我从小开始，\\n就听着父亲的歌长大的缘故吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e4fff037b097f676f90861e850f862d66cfae766973a57bc3ce6cfd0b7e73d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "354"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c00a4eb6183e20ac1f22541",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "怒涛那融入感情和有着精湛转音的歌声……\\n啊，很抱歉我不是在讲竞赛的事情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "501d1bf9bd1219326823b3f56a0c876a23fae7865f82b7ea313eecaae28c8c7c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "355"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62a2fe09ea0d46d833a8b91",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有一点……但紧张时只要回想起以前和小钻\\n一起奔跑的事情，就会冷静下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea5b0c559139b931a8020a928468ea6e1f1f7dcce43dcf3a2e6613661ee3cb6b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "356"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:555d4806baf0933382471284",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢！感觉我距离自己所向往的\\n背影又更近一步了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f787c32cde50ec900e122d9d0459443976eae4185bee60035b88eff1bd07bee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "357"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66032f2f5ba35f2c634923ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我把在这场竞赛中发现到的事情写下来了！\\n是想要在决赛前克服的问题点……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06874c8b63bbaf2340cad750ef0fd0dab1604941edc6681ee16d043efef5cc5d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "358"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aaec99bd993fe6e5b82e4ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有、有的……但因为「进入闸门后就是\\n武藏与小次郎」！不论是谁我都会全力以赴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e80acb27d6cf6447220c2b840d4ee87858adf564e5b616cd5ea68b4d059d4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "359"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8215a8a8f28d238ce3391fa1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与母亲不相上下是指要成为\\n「在竞赛史上留名的赛马娘」。我还差得远。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa4058934fc94f3bf4519965e8b2e0157b0e5f3bcd596b9f5dd820d853e50214",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "36"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab54d3efb9236a76f19c6f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "乳清蛋白。青花菜。菲力牛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "175ada32ccb2738aeb57c978378f33481d9d90358559a657f843cf6b599466da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "360"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ba96b026eb327de685b3a64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，小狗。比赛时也会紧跟过来，\\n是个听话的好孩子喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f054edd1f24f59dd021638d61081b8c09e45540d80ef2ff2f4aa770181dbf62b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b39fb16412ddbe074701a770",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这种问题的答案只有一个吧。\\n闪耀的一等星……看着我就够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b4c4d31a537b13874feb3ea72a740829c3f99659c0e25e0783020ccf6df8aac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "362"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:998762b721c782e235eb33c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我下场比赛的目标也是要用尽全力\\n在大家心中留下印象。还请看着我的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93cbc2dd5f2977e598021195d9bfc3cf76b9caf5f1e3c1cd5312a417ec6cb460",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "363"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f82346b95c23921c5f8cf28",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我跑得相当舒服……\\n对我来说，没有比这更值得感到喜悦的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e6a8b01578dbb1ba1c6a6754071d7b430afe7eae8c14d87ed7efd34847d30b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "364"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d1f63593dcf2f4d350e462c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我一定会赌上自己的一切，\\n持续跑到决赛为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00092ebd2f7851859e4c84981b4c5b8c192a686b783b198596edca43d69d3263",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "365"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2644daceb1dcba4371fef93",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论有多想努力锻炼，若没有人给予指引\\n便会误入歧途。而你正是我的路标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "730d9c8eac5111e09f383b087985ec66c3f8d50be8304172233f665e710efe26",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "366"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48bdd65f392b4ad5ce77da9c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我从现在起要去将八重垣流的强悍之处和精神\\n传达到竞赛的世界！请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fd14ec2cc1058881d21c6491167efe448022a4c71a2131c9b25a34dda50ef17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "367"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c44012183188705769473218",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "卸下一切的伪装，拿出自己的一切互相较劲。\\n这恰恰等同于以真本事交锋的对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06ee65043002bd292ec05f109471bd733fd3385e7d33df38657693ff3733c618",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "368"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3d45ca3dfb8ae3f1ed27917",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦？啊，我满脸都是笑容吗……！？\\n真不好意思！我以后会注意的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e97909461ed589f7c1127355d321f5f89e8384ed0af1b4cb72458bf3540468",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "37"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c27114c03911b0d5ae88d59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就只能去累积能超越她们的修练成果了呢～\\n正所谓「没有能战胜努力的天赋」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80c677cc22508f59eea059f0a41a4a6c2318a98b625c0bacaa061347e7e13594",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "372"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e4a5f5e6e41b7a161b8d01",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀！若能与我敬爱的姐姐们在荣耀的舞台上\\n互相较劲，那真的是很幸运呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d484cad70c57db39c6f8be302cb3a43673168f22cd44c6e44ba51d2c7937152",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "373"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:446236e1eddbc4bd6e80730f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，训练员有特别叮嘱我\\n要对这一类的提问保密了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2c57e1b2666d35a74c650ebba697b201fe1a8ba873bdc4a0addc0c6e024f414",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "374"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ef57d240f537338b7c90c2d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实他们有一起在线观看我的比赛喔！\\n而且大大地称赞了我一番呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37f35bfb883db9eaa737ff5c85c14dd3fb0922fb2ec313736d68aedea8bb3af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "378"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfb882bf6846a92eb3d2a648",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获胜的话会有「爆进式的庆功宴」\\n在等着我……所以今天暂时先保留♪　",
      "source_fingerprint": "a854777072887d0b33794ab488073d23c1a097099ca8ec474e620c9e4dfccbe8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "379"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4398e96ba7ca617432769fe5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在想连一秒也不能错过大家的英姿……\\n啊，在尽我最大的努力关注对手的行动！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d259099b2c0a3643b88dea101833a49c33b12b701d084bb3b970b86827a8d49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "38"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5152e077972301ec4a677f33",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢大家一直以来支持着身为花蕾的我，\\n并见证了我绽放的瞬间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c7c449685e5e43c601f029e633c6b0040803057498ebee28ac0e62a300b6b29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "380"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07d007ec6b410b40f4117340",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想决赛时要面对的挑战会变得更加严峻！\\n但我会加油的，还请大家声援我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "167680e523683ea98bffa6829727bcebdf99b39ecdf3df664312684e34116141",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b36e79d673516dd074b0e7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我知道大家都很强！\\n正因如此我才想要超越大家……我会超越的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d26c7cddeac4bc52053097e9ee23c9ef13fadf95cf9cd663a7238a5fb160207b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "382"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
